<rml>
<head>
	<!--
		The history plaque's card (I11 step 5; ADR-0019 §6): what a console room's plaque says, in full, over the room.
		Interact on the plaque beside the hero corner opens it (VR's ray too); Up and Down scroll its text; Back (B, Esc)
		or activate closes it. Bound to the data model "room_plaque" of rv::app::PlaqueCardPanel
		(src/app/src/plaque_card_panel.cpp), which also names the ids below: keep them in step
		(src/app/include/rv/app/plaque_card_ui.hpp, tests/unit/app/test_history_plaques.cpp). The name, the maker, the
		year, the type and the description are the theme's text as it comes (data, not sentences of the UI); an empty
		field reads "n.d." (non disponibile). The logo is the system's (rv-texture:logo-<system>, I11 step 3) when the UI
		has it.
	-->
	<title>Targa</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="room_plaque.rcss"/>
</head>
<body id="room-plaque" data-model="room_plaque">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="head">
			<p class="kicker">Targa della stanza</p>
			<div id="plaque-logo" class="logo" data-if="logo != ''"><img data-attr-src="logo"/></div>
			<h2 id="plaque-name">{{ name }}</h2>
		</div>
		<div id="plaque-body" class="body">
			<div class="rows">
				<div class="row"><span class="key">Produttore</span><span class="value"><span data-if="maker != ''">{{ maker }}</span><span data-if="maker == ''">n.d.</span></span></div>
				<div class="row"><span class="key">Anno</span><span class="value"><span data-if="year != ''">{{ year }}</span><span data-if="year == ''">n.d.</span></span></div>
				<div class="row"><span class="key">Tipo</span><span class="value"><span data-if="type != ''">{{ type }}</span><span data-if="type == ''">n.d.</span></span></div>
			</div>
			<p id="plaque-description" class="description">{{ description }}</p>
		</div>
		<p class="close">Indietro per chiudere</p>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
